# Sales Analytics Dashboard

This project is a **React-based analytics dashboard** that demonstrates how to use different charting libraries for **data visualization**. It was developed as part of Practical 7: Data Visualization.

##  Features
- **Monthly Sales Chart (Line Chart)** using Recharts
- **Product Category Chart (Pie Chart)** using Recharts
- **Customer Acquisition Chart (Bar Chart)** using react-chartjs-2
- **Weekly Visitors Chart (Area Chart)** using react-chartjs-2
- Responsive and interactive charts
- Clean and modular component structure

## Project Setup
1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/syangche/Data-Visualisation.git

2. Navigate into the project folder:

    bash
    cd Data-Visualisation

3. Install dependencies:

    bash
    npm install

4. Run the development server:

    npm run dev

## File Structure
    src/
 ├── components/
 │    ├── MonthlySalesChart.jsx
 │    ├── ProductCategoryChart.jsx
 │    ├── CustomerAcquisitionChart.jsx
 │    └── WeeklyVisitorsChart.jsx
 ├── data/
 │    └── salesData.js
 ├── App.jsx
 └── App.css

## Libraries Used

Recharts – for Line and Pie charts

react-chartjs-2 (react-chartjs-2.js.org in Bing) – for Bar and Area charts

date-fns – for date formatting

## Learning Outcomes

Implementing charting libraries in React

Creating different chart types

Making charts responsive and interactive

Loading and transforming data

Optimizing charts for performance